<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Amlac lists 21 mln shares on JSE.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Amlac lists 21 mln shares on JSE.</headline>
<text>
<p>JOHANNESBURG, Nov 6 (reuter) - Amlac Ltd will list 21 million ordinary shares with a value of one cent each on the Industrial-&quot;Stores&quot; sector of the Johannesburg Stock Exchange with effect from Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
